{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8b981a3f7d40e698d2d73c45b4f4fe33.poster.avif?t=1770028006\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8b981a3f7d40e698d2d73c45b4f4fe33.webm?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8b981a3f7d40e698d2d73c45b4f4fe33.mp4?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Magin: The Rat Project Stories</i> takes place in a dark fantasy world, where magic \u2013 or essence, as it is called \u2013 is directly tied to the desires and fears of its inhabitants.<br> <br>Shape the fate of Elester, a Magin and veteran hitman in an underworld syndicate, as well as young Tolen, who is about to realize that he too can use the essence to his advantage.<br><br>Step into a mature, magical world standing on the edge of an industrial revolution and utter chaos. <br><br>Overcome obstacles, play your cards wisely, and find your destiny in this immersive, story-driven adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/572be0b0069db5dff40dcc8f588958fd.avif?t=1770028006\" width=780 height=128 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore atmospheric and mysterious locations by investigating the environment, and interacting with items.<br></li><li>Battle horrific creatures and meet numerous complex characters - potential allies or foes.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8082381b22fa181bf72efa97dc7c116b.poster.avif?t=1770028006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8082381b22fa181bf72efa97dc7c116b.webm?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8082381b22fa181bf72efa97dc7c116b.mp4?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/6923c7a06ce0552db578810abdf8ee11.avif?t=1770028006\" width=780 height=128 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage your essence by utilizing emotions, both in combat and during exploration.<br></li><li>The emotional state of your character influences the story and various gameplay mechanics.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0d4ea85d6542e8114b966e3b8253dd15.poster.avif?t=1770028006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0d4ea85d6542e8114b966e3b8253dd15.webm?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0d4ea85d6542e8114b966e3b8253dd15.mp4?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/abe0b60461369a0b207a63b58231c4b2.avif?t=1770028006\" width=780 height=128 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in a cold and harsh fantasy world where medieval culture is confronted with the invention of industrial, magic-powered machines, and the forces that seek to control them.<br></li><li>Follow the main characters on their journey of lost and redeemed hope and decide its outcome based on your choices.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/770747c2acac1e82cb1b67488ef07761.poster.avif?t=1770028006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/770747c2acac1e82cb1b67488ef07761.webm?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/770747c2acac1e82cb1b67488ef07761.mp4?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/d322a97c876e01195f6f6703b41395d4.avif?t=1770028006\" width=780 height=128 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage and upgrade your deck as the story progresses.<br></li><li>Gain special cards from story choices and defeated enemies.<br></li><li>Craft unique double-sided, emotion-infused essence cards fitting your strategy.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/5afe8d3b6f6792c47deb0c90ebdfc644.poster.avif?t=1770028006\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/5afe8d3b6f6792c47deb0c90ebdfc644.webm?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/5afe8d3b6f6792c47deb0c90ebdfc644.mp4?t=1770028006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1205270?t=1770028006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770028006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam